<tr style='background:#1E293B; transition:0.2s;' onmouseover='this.style.background="#334155"' onmouseout='this.style.background="#1E293B"'><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#38BDF8; font-weight:600; vertical-align:top;'>Certiorari ΓÇö ΓÇ£To...</td><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#E2E8F0; vertical-align:top; line-height:1.6;'>Certiorari ΓÇö ΓÇ£To be certifiedΓÇ¥ Issued by a higher court to transfer a case pending in the lower court to itself or nullifies the lower court's order if it</td></tr>
