<tr style='background:#1E293B; transition:0.2s;' onmouseover='this.style.background="#334155"' onmouseout='this.style.background="#1E293B"'><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#38BDF8; font-weight:600; vertical-align:top;'>Justice V. Ramaswami...</td><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#E2E8F0; vertical-align:top; line-height:1.6;'>Justice V. Ramaswami was the first <strong>Supreme Court</strong> judge to face impeachment proceedings, with a motion initiated against him in 1991.</td></tr>
