<tr style='background:#0F172A; transition:0.2s;' onmouseover='this.style.background="#334155"' onmouseout='this.style.background="#0F172A"'><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#38BDF8; font-weight:600; vertical-align:top;'>or a pleader...</td><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#E2E8F0; vertical-align:top; line-height:1.6;'>or a pleader and is recommended by the <strong>High Court</strong> for appointment.</td></tr>
