<tr style='background:#1E293B; transition:0.2s;' onmouseover='this.style.background="#334155"' onmouseout='this.style.background="#1E293B"'><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#38BDF8; font-weight:600; vertical-align:top;'>rticle 237</td><td style='padding:12px; border:1px solid #475569; color:#E2E8F0; vertical-align:top; line-height:1.6;'>The Governor can extend judicial service rules to certain magistrates under <strong>Article 237</strong> of the Constitution of India.</td></tr>
